  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate pH at which an acid indicator HIn with concentration 0.1 M changes its colour ( <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math> for HIn <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math> )."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Indicator equation is<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br />Colour change takes place when <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>]</mo></math><br />i.e., when <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> ."
